-- title:
--   Level-two certificate data, part parta
-- statement:
--   One quarter of the per-region certificate data for the level-two entropy floors: for each region, the mode whose parent grade is two, the reference exponents of the two outer grades and of the middle grade, and the numerator of the region's certified entropy floor over ten to the thirtieth.
-- source:
--   Certified evaluation of the entropy rates of the More-Asymmetry regional extraction (https://arxiv.org/html/2404.16349v2, section 6).

